            { name: "Silver Solder/Brazing Alloys", how: "Silver-copper-zinc alloys (45\u201372% Ag) that melt at 600\u2013800\xB0C. Used in HVAC, plumbing, and electrical contacts where strong, corrosion-resistant joints are needed." }
